+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+The project's cache eviction policy is LRU (Least Recently Used), with entries additionally expiring via an explicit 300-second TTL: the cache evicts the least recently accessed entries when it reaches capacity, and any entry is removed automatically once it has existed for 300 seconds regardless of access patterns.
